# S.S. Botany Bay: its {T} ability exiles one card from each graveyard. Bot1's graveyard holds two cards it may exile
# (Bear Cub and a Black Lotus), and "you may exile A card" takes exactly one: the question must refuse both. Only the
# creature card Bot1 owns is linked to Botany Bay, so when the now-creature Botany Bay deals combat damage, that Bear Cub
# returns to Bot1's hand, and the Grizzly Bears Bot2 exiled - a card Bot1 does not own - stays in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
S.S. Botany Bay
Bear Cub
Forest
Gigantosaurus
Forest
Island x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x5
Grizzly Bears
Island x14

